# Backups and working copies of the above. `.env*.local` does NOT cover these — it
# requires the name to *end* in `.local`, so `.env.local.bak` was untracked but
# perfectly committable: one `git add -A` away from real secrets in the repository.
.env*.bak
.env*.backup
.env*.old
.env*.orig
.env*.save
.env.local*
!.env.example

